{"id":"9b989a62f7579fbb","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-poset-domain-basis.md","title":"ZFC Poset Domain Basis","display":"df-zfc-poset-domain-basis — ZFC Poset Domain Basis","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-poset-domain-basis","aliases":["58-df-zfc-poset-domain-basis"],"display":"df-zfc-poset-domain-basis — ZFC Poset Domain Basis","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-poset-dcpo.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-poset-way-below-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-poset-domain-basis"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-poset-domain-basis</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-poset-domain-basis — ZFC Poset Domain Basis"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fd1bbc49a4004fb5\" href=\"?note=fd1bbc49a4004fb5\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-poset-dcpo.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-poset-dcpo.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3ddc5c0eefd8ae40\" href=\"?note=3ddc5c0eefd8ae40\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-poset-way-below-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-poset-way-below-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,P,\\leq\\in V\">\\(B,P,\\leq\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq P\">\\(B\\subseteq P\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(\\leq\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDomainBasis}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDomainBasis}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDcpo}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDcpo}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fd1bbc49a4004fb5\" href=\"?note=fd1bbc49a4004fb5\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-poset-dcpo.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-poset-dcpo.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetWayBelowRelation}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetWayBelowRelation}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3ddc5c0eefd8ae40\" href=\"?note=3ddc5c0eefd8ae40\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-poset-way-below-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-poset-way-below-relation.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}domain\\text{-}basis}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDomainBasis}_S(B,P,\\leq)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDcpo}_S(P,\\leq)\\land B\\subseteq P\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\exists D\\subseteq B\\;\\Bigl(\nD=\\{b\\in B\\mid\\mathrm{ZfcPosetWayBelowRelation}_S(b,x,P,\\leq)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{19mm}{}\\land D\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall u,v\\in D\\;\\exists w\\in D\\;(u\\leq w\\land v\\leq w)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{19mm}{}\\land\\forall d\\in D\\;(d\\leq x)\n\\land\\forall y\\in P\\;((\\forall d\\in D\\;(d\\leq y))\\to x\\leq y)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}domain\\text{-}basis}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDomainBasis}_S(B,P,\\leq)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDcpo}_S(P,\\leq)\\land B\\subseteq P\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\exists D\\subseteq B\\;\\Bigl(\nD=\\{b\\in B\\mid\\mathrm{ZfcPosetWayBelowRelation}_S(b,x,P,\\leq)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{19mm}{}\\land D\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall u,v\\in D\\;\\exists w\\in D\\;(u\\leq w\\land v\\leq w)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{19mm}{}\\land\\forall d\\in D\\;(d\\leq x)\n\\land\\forall y\\in P\\;((\\forall d\\in D\\;(d\\leq y))\\to x\\leq y)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-poset-dcpo.md","status":"resolved","id":"fd1bbc49a4004fb5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-poset-dcpo.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-poset-way-below-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"3ddc5c0eefd8ae40","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-poset-way-below-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-poset-dcpo.md","status":"resolved","id":"fd1bbc49a4004fb5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDcpo}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-poset-dcpo.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-poset-way-below-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"3ddc5c0eefd8ae40","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPosetWayBelowRelation}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (see [[../batch14/58-df-zfc-poset-way-below-relation.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B,P,\\leq\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq P","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq\\subseteq P\\times P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDomainBasis}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDcpo}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetWayBelowRelation}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}domain\\text{-}basis}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDomainBasis}_S(B,P,\\leq)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDcpo}_S(P,\\leq)\\land B\\subseteq P\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\exists D\\subseteq B\\;\\Bigl(\nD=\\{b\\in B\\mid\\mathrm{ZfcPosetWayBelowRelation}_S(b,x,P,\\leq)\\}\\\\\n&\\hspace{19mm}{}\\land D\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall u,v\\in D\\;\\exists w\\in D\\;(u\\leq w\\land v\\leq w)\\\\\n&\\hspace{19mm}{}\\land\\forall d\\in D\\;(d\\leq x)\n\\land\\forall y\\in P\\;((\\forall d\\in D\\;(d\\leq y))\\to x\\leq y)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1381,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3113","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-poset-domain-basis.md|58-df-zfc-poset-domain-basis]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","fd1bbc49a4004fb5","3ddc5c0eefd8ae40"]}